OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric harbour removed from at
OL,4,Arisk register
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fourteenth century Cornish harbour
OL,7,Fhas been moved from Historic England's
OL,8,FAt Risk register after a team spent 18
OL,9,Fmonths restoring it.
OL,11,FNewlyn's Old Harbour is amongst 20
OL,12,Fsites which have been removed from the
OL,13,Flist of historic sites in poor
OL,14,Fcondition in the South West whilst 43
OL,15,Fhave been added, including cairns on St
OL,16,FMary and Tresco, cloisters at Exeter
OL,17,FCathedral and a prehistoric settlement
OL,18,Fin Lundy off the north Devon coast.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
