OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric harbour removed from at
OL,4,Arisk register
OL,5,
OL,6,FNick Howell, who is one of Newlyn's
OL,7,Fharbour commissioners, said: "It's been
OL,8,Flike an archaeological dig. It's like a
OL,9,Fgraveyard for old wooden boats."
OL,11,FThe #10,000 project included restoring
OL,12,Fthe harbour walls, mooring and ladders
OL,13,Fand clearing undergrowth.
